msgstr ""
"Toisc go bhfuil sé áisiúil, bainimis úsáid as API bunachar sonraí Django "
"féin, a chlúdaigh muid i :doc:`Teagasc 2 </intro/tutorial02>`. Seo stab "
"amháin ag radharc nua ``innéacs()``, a thaispeánann na 5 cheist vótaíochta "
"is déanaí sa chóras, scartha le camóga, de réir dáta foilsithe:"

msgid ""
"There's a problem here, though: the page's design is hard-coded in the view. "
"If you want to change the way the page looks, you'll have to edit this "
"Python code. So let's use Django's template system to separate the design "
