msgstr ""
"Ar dtús, cruthaigh eolaire darb ainm ``templates`` i do eolaire `` "
"pobalbhreith ``. Féachfaidh Django le haghaidh teimpléid ann."

msgid ""
"Your project's :setting:`TEMPLATES` setting describes how Django will load "
"and render templates. The default settings file configures a "
"``DjangoTemplates`` backend whose :setting:`APP_DIRS <TEMPLATES-APP_DIRS>` "
"option is set to ``True``. By convention ``DjangoTemplates`` looks for a "
"\"templates\" subdirectory in each of the :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`."
msgstr ""
"Déanann socrú :suíomh:`TEMPLATES` do thionscadal cur síos ar an gcaoi a "
"ndéanfaidh Django teimpléid a luchtú agus a rindreáil. Cumraíonn an comhad "
"socruithe réamhshocraithe inneall ``DjangoTemplates`` a bhfuil a "
"rogha :setting:`APP_DIRS <TEMPLATES-APP_DIRS>` socraithe go ``True``. De "
"réir an ghnáis lorgaíonn ``DjangoTemplates`` fochomhadlann \"teimpléid\" i "
"ngach ceann de na :suíomh:`INSTALLED_APPS`."

msgid ""
"Within the ``templates`` directory you have just created, create another "
"directory called ``polls``, and within that create a file called "
"``index.html``. In other words, your template should be at ``polls/templates/"
