"theimpléad ag ``vótaíocht/templates/polls/index.html``. Mar gheall ar an "
"gcaoi a n-oibríonn an lódóir teimpléid `` app_directories`` mar a "
"thuairiscítear thuas, is féidir leat tagairt a dhéanamh don teimpléad seo "
"laistigh de Django mar `` pobalbhreith / index.html ``."

msgid "Template namespacing"
msgstr "Spásáil ainm teimpléad"

msgid ""
"Now we *might* be able to get away with putting our templates directly in "
"``polls/templates`` (rather than creating another ``polls`` subdirectory), "
"but it would actually be a bad idea. Django will choose the first template "
"it finds whose name matches, and if you had a template with the same name in "
"a *different* application, Django would be unable to distinguish between "
"them. We need to be able to point Django at the right one, and the best way "
"to ensure this is by *namespacing* them. That is, by putting those templates "
"inside *another* directory named for the application itself."
msgstr ""
"Anois * b'fhéidir go mbeimid in ann fáil amach lenár dteimpléid a chur go "
"díreach i `` pobalbhreith / teimpléid `` (seachas fochomhadlann `` "
"pobalbhreith `` eile a chruthú), ach is droch-smaoineamh a bheadh ​​ann i "
"ndáiríre. Roghnóidh Django an chéad teimpléad a aimsíonn sé a bhfuil a ainm "
"ag teacht leis, agus dá mbeadh teimpléad leis an ainm céanna agat in "
"iarratas *difriúil*, ní bheadh ​​Django in ann idirdhealú a dhéanamh eatarthu. "
"Ní mór dúinn a bheith in ann Django a dhíriú ar an gceann ceart, agus is é "
"an bealach is fearr lena chinntiú ná *spásáil * orthu. Is é sin, trí na "
"teimpléid sin a chur san eolaire * eile* atá ainmnithe don fheidhmchlár féin."

