msgid "A shortcut: :func:`~django.shortcuts.get_object_or_404`"
msgstr "Aicearra: :func: `~django.shortcuts.get_object_or_404`"

msgid ""
"It's a very common idiom to use :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get` "
"and raise :exc:`~django.http.Http404` if the object doesn't exist. Django "
"provides a shortcut. Here's the ``detail()`` view, rewritten:"
msgstr ""
"Is idiom an-choitianta é :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get` a "
"úsáid agus ardaigh :exc:`~django.http.Http404` mura bhfuil an réad ann. "
"Soláthraíonn Django aicearra. Seo an radharc ``detail()``, athscríofa:"

msgid ""
"The :func:`~django.shortcuts.get_object_or_404` function takes a Django "
"model as its first argument and an arbitrary number of keyword arguments, "
"which it passes to the :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get` function "
"of the model's manager. It raises :exc:`~django.http.Http404` if the object "
"doesn't exist."
msgstr ""
"Glacann an fheidhm :func:`~django.shortcuts.get_object_or_404` múnla Django "
"mar a chéad argóint agus líon treallach argóintí eochairfhocail, a théann sé "
"chuig an :meth:`~ django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get ` feidhm bhainisteoir "
"an mhúnla. Ardaíonn sé :exc:`~django.http.Http404` mura bhfuil an réad ann."

msgid ""
"Why do we use a helper function :func:`~django.shortcuts.get_object_or_404` "
"instead of automatically catching "
"the :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.ObjectDoesNotExist` exceptions at a higher "
"level, or having the model API raise :exc:`~django.http.Http404` instead "
"of :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.ObjectDoesNotExist`?"
msgstr ""
"Cén fáth a n-úsáidimid feidhm "
"chúntóra :func:`~django.shortcuts.get_object_or_404` in ionad na "
"heisceachtaí :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.ObjectDoesNotExist` a ghlacadh go "
"huathoibríoch ag leibhéal níos airde, nó an tsamhail API a "
"ardú :exc :`~django.http.Http404` in "
"ionad :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.ObjectDoesNotExist`?"

msgid ""
"Because that would couple the model layer to the view layer. One of the "
"foremost design goals of Django is to maintain loose coupling. Some "
"controlled coupling is introduced in the :mod:`django.shortcuts` module."
msgstr ""
"Toisc go gceanglódh sé sin an ciseal samhail leis an gciseal radhairc. Is é "
"ceann de na príomhspriocanna deartha atá ag Django ná cúpláil scaoilte a "
"choinneáil. Tugtar roinnt cúplála rialaithe isteach sa "
"mhodúl :mod:`django.shortcuts`."

msgid ""
"There's also a :func:`~django.shortcuts.get_list_or_404` function, which "
"works just as :func:`~django.shortcuts.get_object_or_404` -- except "
"using :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.filter` instead "
"of :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get`. It "
"raises :exc:`~django.http.Http404` if the list is empty."
msgstr ""
"Tá feidhm :func:`~django.shortcuts.get_list_or_404` ann freisin, a oibríonn "
"díreach mar :func:`~django.shortcuts.get_object_or_404` -- ach amháin ag "
"baint úsáide as :meth:`~ django.db.models.query.QuerySet. scagaire` in "
"ionad :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get`. Ardaíonn "
"sé :exc:`~django.http.Http404` má tá an liosta folamh."

