msgid "A quick rundown:"
msgstr "Léiriú tapa:"

msgid ""
"The above template displays a radio button for each question choice. The "
"``value`` of each radio button is the associated question choice's ID. The "
"``name`` of each radio button is ``\"choice\"``. That means, when somebody "
"selects one of the radio buttons and submits the form, it'll send the POST "
"data ``choice=#`` where # is the ID of the selected choice. This is the "
"basic concept of HTML forms."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann an teimpléad thuas cnaipe raidió do gach rogha ceiste. Is é "
"``luach`` gach cnaipe raidió ná ID an rogha ceiste gaolmhar. Is é ``ainm`` "
"gach cnaipe raidió ná ``\"rogha\"``. Ciallaíonn sé sin, nuair a roghnaíonn "
"duine éigin ceann de na cnaipí raidió agus nuair a sheolann sé isteach an "
"fhoirm, seolfaidh sé na sonraí POST `` rogha = #`` áit arb é # ID an rogha "
"roghnaithe. Is é seo an coincheap bunúsach foirmeacha HTML."

msgid ""
"We set the form's ``action`` to ``{% url 'polls:vote' question.id %}``, and "
"we set ``method=\"post\"``. Using ``method=\"post\"`` (as opposed to "
"``method=\"get\"``) is very important, because the act of submitting this "
"form will alter data server-side. Whenever you create a form that alters "
"data server-side, use ``method=\"post\"``. This tip isn't specific to "
"Django; it's good web development practice in general."
msgstr ""
"Shocraigh muid ``gníomh`` na foirme go ``{%url' vótaíocht:vóta' question.id "
"%}``, agus leagamar síos ``modh=\"post\"``. Tá sé an-tábhachtach úsáid a "
"bhaint as ``modh=\"post\"`` (seachas ``modh=\"faigh\"``) mar go n-athróidh "
"an gníomh chun an fhoirm seo a chur isteach taobh an fhreastalaí sonraí. Aon "
"uair a chruthaíonn tú foirm a athraíonn taobh an fhreastalaí sonraí, úsáid "
"`` method=\"post\"``. Ní bhaineann an leid seo go sonrach le Django; is dea-"
"chleachtas forbartha gréasáin é go ginearálta."

msgid ""
"``forloop.counter`` indicates how many times the :ttag:`for` tag has gone "
"through its loop"
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn ``forloop.counter`` cá mhéad uair a chuaigh an chlib :ttag:`for` "
"trína lúb"

msgid ""
"Since we're creating a POST form (which can have the effect of modifying "
"data), we need to worry about Cross Site Request Forgeries. Thankfully, you "
"don't have to worry too hard, because Django comes with a helpful system for "
"protecting against it. In short, all POST forms that are targeted at "
"internal URLs should use the :ttag:`{% csrf_token %}<csrf_token>` template "
"tag."
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é go bhfuil foirm POST á cruthú againn (ar féidir leis an éifeacht "
"sonraí a mhodhnú), ní mór dúinn a bheith buartha faoi Bhronntanais Iarratas "
"Trasláithreáin. Ar an dea-uair, ní gá duit a bheith buartha ró-chrua, mar "
"tagann Django le córas cabhrach chun é a chosaint. I mbeagán focal, ba "
"cheart do gach foirm POST atá dírithe ar URLanna inmheánacha an chlib "
"teimpléad :ttag:`{% csrf_token %} <csrf_token>` a úsáid."

